    <preface>
      <p>Biological Control Amendment Act 2016</p>
      <p>No. 28, 2016</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Biological Control Act 1984</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	1</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Biological Control Act 1984	3</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Biological Control Act 1984</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 23 March 2016</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act may be cited as the <i>Biological Control Amendment </i><i>Act 201</i><i>6</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  Sections 1 to 3 and anything in this Act not elsewhere covered by this table</td>
              <td>The day this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>23 March 2016</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>2.  Schedule 1</td>
              <td>A single day to be fixed by Proclamation.</td>
              <td>1 January 2017
(F2016N00045)</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Biological Control Act 1984</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Subsection 2(1) (definition of kind)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “organisms”, insert “, viruses or sub-viral agents”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Subsection 2(1) (at the end of the definition of organism)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; or (c)	a virus or a sub-viral agent.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Subsection 2(1) (definition of prescribed live organisms)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the definition.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>Subsection 2(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>prescribed organisms</i></b> means organisms that are:</p>
                </content>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>live organisms; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>viruses or sub-viral agents;</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>but does not include live vaccines or resistant cultivars.</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Section 3</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “live”, substitute “prescribed”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>Subsections 21(1), 22(1) and 26(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “live”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-7">
              <num>7</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 30(1)(b), 31(1)(a) and 34(2)(a)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “live”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>Subsection 37(3)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “live”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9">
              <num>9</num>
              <heading>Declarations of relevant State laws</heading>
              <content>
                <p>If:</p>
              </content>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__para-a">
                <num>a</num>
                <content>
                  <p>	(a)	a declaration was made under <ref href="#sec-9">section 9</ref> of the <i>Biological Control Act 1984</i> before the commencement of this item; and</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
              <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-9__para-b">
                <num>b</num>
                <content>
                  <p>the declaration was in effect immediately before that commencement;</p>
                </content>
                <content>
                  <p>the declaration continues in effect (and may be dealt with), after that commencement, despite the amendments made by this Schedule.</p>
                  <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                  <p><i>House of Representatives on 25 February 2016</i></p>
                  <p><i>Senate on 16 March 2016</i>]</p>
                  <p>(24/16)</p>
                </content>
              </paragraph>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
